- Horizon: near → mid
+ Horizon: near → mid

- Needs: core-1
+ Needs: core-1

- Baseline: 219 files (measured 2026-08-01)
+ Baseline: 219 files (measured 2026-08-01)

- One or two sentences of prose.
+ One or two sentences of prose.

- Done when:
